	(text "POWER: 2 x LiPo pouch (~1200 mAh each, own protection PCBs) in parallel on J1 / J2 -> VBAT.\nVBAT goes to the XIAO's underside BAT+ pad (XIAO makes 3V3, reads VBAT on P0.31, charges at 50 mA).\nU2 MCP73831 adds 500 mA from the XIAO's 5V pin (USB VBUS; floats on battery). CHG_STAT -> D9 (low = charging)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1af915c7-fcff-555d-8127-389c888c6f91")
	)
	(text "MCU: XIAO nRF52840 Sense, castellations + BAT pads reflowed flat (the pod is thin; no sockets).\nD8 / D3 LED data A / B (left / right pin row, toward each half's buffer), D2 LED_EN, D1 BTN (any pin wakes\nSystem OFF; internal pull-up), D9 CHG_STAT. D0, D4-D7, D10 spare (D4/D5 = I2C). On the XIAO: PDM mic (music), IMU (tap / nod), USB-C at the pod's lower edge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "eeee14bd-e79c-5991-8b99-6dead865815b")
	)
	(text "LED BAND: 12 x 208 px at 2.8 mm (2,496 addressable LEDs), two flex halves of 12 x 104, one per side,\nboth starting at the back seam. Q1 / Q2 AO3401A switch VBAT to each half (R3 holds them off),\nQ3 drives the gates from LED_EN (R5 keeps it off at boot). VLED = VBAT 3.0-4.2 V.\nFirmware caps the band at 2.4 A total (1.2 A per plug; ~0.6 A of each is the LEDs' idle) and stops below VBAT 3.5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "34d1dd7d-f44f-50fb-9de1-5ff370c99926")
	)
	(text "DATA: U3 / U4 SN74LV1T34 on VLED take the 3.3 V GPIO (VIH 2.0 V) to a full VLED swing, 100R series.\nKeep LED data low before LED_EN goes low (the buffers' Ioff inputs tolerate it either way)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04403f7c-0375-5335-b75f-89a02ea645c8")
	)
